<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLOs end quiet day with pared gains.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLOs end quiet day with pared gains.</headline>
<text>
<p>1610 GMT - Linear bonds ended quiet Tuesday with pared gains after light profit-taking, but traders said they expected the market to maintain its upward move.</p>
<p>*2007 OLO 5.64% (5.68) BE286=, 6 bps over Bunds (7)  MEUR</p>
<p>*OLO fut +0.23 at 122.88 BGBc1 ; Mark/Bfr 20.6300/10 (6315/45)</p>
<p>*3-mo bill 3.04/06% IRGHWI01 ;1-wk repo 3.05/08</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
